  \textit{"Web Summit is a perfect illustration of the power of community. People rely on communities to educate and to help plan for change."}\\[25pt]
  {\fontsize{34}{44}\selectfont\bfseries\color{textgray} — Alicia Tillman, CMO, SAP}
}

